 "brief": "Two Palestinians, including a child, sustained gunshot wounds Sunday evening after Israeli occupation forces opened fire in Khan Younis, a city in southern Gaza, Shehab Wire reported. The shooting marked the latest incident of armed confrontation in the densely populated area.\n\nThe identities and ages of the wounded were not disclosed. Their current medical condition remained unclear as of the report. Khan Younis, home to a large civilian population, has endured repeated military operations and clashes since the outbreak of hostilities.",
